# Upstream's file was `* text=auto`, which normalizes line endings on checkout. Inside this
# repository that is destructive: `provenance.json` records a digest per file and 124 vendored files
# carry CRLF, so normalization would leave `LICENSE` and `.gitignore` here failing their own
# recorded digests and report a healthy delivered tree as tampered with. The bytes are kept as the
# pinned commit has them, which is what the integrity manifest asserts.
* -text -diff
